↑	Move a single card up
Command+↑ (Mac) or
Ctrl+↑ (Windows/Linux)	Move a single card to the top of the column
←	Move card(s) left
Command+← (Mac) or
Ctrl+← (Windows/Linux)	Move card(s) to the leftmost column
→	Move card(s) right
Command+→ (Mac) or
Ctrl+→ (Windows/Linux)	Move card(s) to the rightmost column
GitHub Actions
